  "details": "Yeah uh, lets make every button smaller and harder to see. \n\nAll the text smaller too. \n\nNo option to resize any of it. \n\nThen we bury everything under dozens of other menus too while you're busy squinting.\n\nLets also move everything over from having actual titles to it, to having hieroglyphic symbols so people unfamiliar with this software have no clue what button actually does what. \n\nNo hover tooltips? Or is the text for them so tiny that i can't even see them with my prescription lens inserts?",
